Remember this number: Nine,seven,four....
趕緊記住號碼:9,7,4….

173
00:14:10,44 --> 00:14:14,21
Okay,and here we have the last of Paolo's grappa.
最後這是保羅的格拉巴酒

174
00:14:14,38 --> 00:14:17,04
Wait,isn't it almost pure
等等,這不是幾乎純…

175
00:14:21,26 --> 00:14:25,06
How can I dump this woman on Valentine's Day?
我怎能在情人節甩掉她

176
00:14:25,26 --> 00:14:28,89
I don't know. You dumped her on New Year's.
天曉得,但你在新年甩掉她

177
00:14:29,40 --> 00:14:33,77
In my next life, I'm coming back as a toilet brush.
下輩子我要當馬桶刷

178
00:14:35,14 --> 00:14:38,54
Hello,funny valentine!
有趣的情人

179
00:14:38,74 --> 00:14:41,23
Hi,just Janice.
珍妮絲

180
00:14:41,44 --> 00:14:44,38
Hello,Joey,our little matchmaker.
喬伊,我們的小媒婆

181
00:14:44,55 --> 00:14:47,84
I could just kiss you all over, and I'm gonna.
我忍不住想吻你

182
00:14:52,79 --> 00:14:56,72
If you don't do it,I will.
如果你不敢,就讓我來開口

183
00:15:15,48 --> 00:15:21,01
-So are you actually from New York? -Not originally. I'm from
-你真的從紐約來的? -本來不是,我從

184
00:15:21,18 --> 00:15:25,28
-You said they'd shoot it without you. -I thought they could.
-你說他們可以自己做 -我以為他們可以

185
00:15:25,49 --> 00:15:31,43
The maxi-pads were a piece of cake. Mini-pads should be that much easier.
最大版都是小菜一碟 最小版當然是更簡單一些了啊

186
00:15:31,59 --> 00:15:35,55
-It's Valentine's Day. -I know,but it's my job.
-但現在是情人節 我知道,但這是我的工作

187
00:15:35,73 --> 00:15:38,89
I'll try to get back as soon as I can.
我會盡量趕回來,抱歉

188
00:15:39,17 --> 00:15:42,26
I'm spending most of my time teaching science...
但我大部分時間都在教科學

189
00:15:42,47 --> 00:15:47,24
...which is funny because that wasn't even my major.
真好笑,我又不是主修科學

190
00:15:58,39 --> 00:16:01,45
Now,that is funny!
真好笑

191
00:16:03,69 --> 00:16:09,03
Do you think it would be too weird if I invited Carol over to join us?
我邀卡蘿過來會很奇怪嗎?

192
00:16:09,20 --> 00:16:14,76
Because she's alone now. And pregnant. And sad.
因為她現在一個人,懷孕了,心情又不好

193
00:16:14,97 --> 00:16:18,93
-I guess. -Are you sure? Carol!
-大概吧 -你確定?卡蘿!

194
00:16:19,11 --> 00:16:21,94
-Wanna join us? -No,I'm fine.
-願意過來坐嗎? -不,我沒事

195
00:16:22,14 --> 00:16:25,44
Come on. These people will scooch down.
來吧,這些人會挪過去的

196
00:16:26,55 --> 00:16:31,95
You guys will scooch,won't you? Let's try scooching! Come on!
你們會挪過去的,對吧? 各位挪過去好嗎,動起來

197
00:16:32,15 --> 00:16:35,28
-Come on. -Thank you.
-拜託 -謝謝

198
00:16:36,56 --> 00:16:40,72
IKristen Riggs,this is Carol Willick. Carol,Kristen.
克莉絲汀,這位是卡蘿 卡蘿,克莉絲汀

199
00:16:40,96 --> 00:16:44,73
-How do you do? -Carol teaches sixth grade.
-你好 -卡蘿教六年級

200
00:16:45,13 --> 00:16:47,60
And Kristen....
克莉絲汀…

201
00:16:50,74 --> 00:16:54,07
IKristen does something...
克莉絲汀…

202
00:16:54,61 --> 00:16:57,81
...that,funnily enough...
最好笑的是

203
00:16:58,18 --> 00:17:01,77
...wasn't even her major!
是她的工作不是她的主修

204
00:17:03,72 --> 00:17:08,21
-Thanks for coming over. -Not at all. It's pretty much our job.
-謝謝你們能來 -沒關係.這是我們的工作

205
00:17:08,42 --> 00:17:11,19
That's why we get the cool hats.
這就是我們為什麼戴這麼酷的帽子啊

206
00:17:11,39 --> 00:17:15,83
-What do we got there? -A piece of sik boxer shorts.
-裡面有什麼東西? 一些真絲四角內褲

207
00:17:16,03 --> 00:17:18,36
Some greeting cards.
問候卡

208
00:17:19,27 --> 00:17:21,83
A half-charred picture of....
燒焦的照片

209
00:17:22,04 --> 00:17:25,20
That guy's hairier than the chief!
這傢伙的體毛比隊長的還濃密

210
00:17:28,11 --> 00:17:32,01
It's a really funny story how this happened.
這件事說來好笑

211
00:17:32,21 --> 00:17:37,55
I was taking out the trash, and Phoebe was burning incense
我拿出垃圾桶,菲比點燃熏香

212
00:17:37,72 --> 00:17:39,08
It's all right.
沒關係.你們不用解釋

213
00:17:39,29 --> 00:17:44,35
This isn't the first boyfriend bonfire we've seen get out of control.
這不是第一件燒燬男友物品失控的事件了

214
00:17:45,06 --> 00:17:47,43
-Third one tonight. -Really?
-這已是今晚的第三件 -真的?

215
00:17:47,59 --> 00:17:51,79
Valentine's is our busiest night of the year.
情人節之夜是我們最忙的時刻

216
00:17:53,80 --> 00:17:57,13
Next time you're burning your ex-boyfriend's stuff:
下一次燒你們前男友的東西時:

217
00:17:57,34 --> 00:18:00,24
One,do it in a well-ventilated area.
第一,在一個通風好的地方

218
00:18:00,44 --> 00:18:05,61
Two,if you wanna burn his clothing, stay away from synthetic fabrics.
第二,如果你們要燒衣服,小心合成纖維的

219
00:18:05,81 --> 00:18:11,48
Three,try to let go of the anger, and learn to love yourself.
第三,試著放掉你們的怒氣 學會愛護自己啊

220
00:18:13,59 --> 00:18:17,49
-I brought you something. -ls it loaded?
-我帶了東西給你 -裝上子彈了沒?

221
00:18:20,89 --> 00:18:26,89
Oh,little candy hearts. "Chan and Jan Forever."
心型糖果「錢德與珍尼絲,永遠」

222
00:18:27,57 --> 00:18:30,37
I had them made special.
我訂做的

223
00:18:33,47 --> 00:18:36,24
Okay,Janice.
ok,珍妮絲…

224
00:18:38,48 --> 00:18:41,14
Hey,Janice.
嗨,珍妮絲…

225
00:18:42,88 --> 00:18:45,22
There's no way to tell you this.
我不該告訴你

226
00:18:45,39 --> 00:18:47,88
At least,there's no new way.
至少沒有別的方法來告訴你

227
00:18:51,02 --> 00:18:55,15
I just don't think things are gonna work out.
我覺得我們不會結果

228
00:18:56,53 --> 00:19:00,13
That's fine.
無所謂

229
00:19:01,64 --> 00:19:03,47
It is?
It is? 是嗎?

230
00:19:03,67 --> 00:19:08,63
Because I know that this isn't the end.
因為我知道我們還沒結束

231
00:19:09,24 --> 00:19:11,73
You see,actually,it is.
事實上已經結束了

232
00:19:11,91 --> 00:19:14,75
No,because you won't let that happen.
不,還沒因為你不會讓它發生的

233
00:19:14,95 --> 00:19:16,78
Don't you know it yet?
難道你還不懂?

234
00:19:16,95 --> 00:19:21,39
You love me,Chandler Bing!
你愛我,錢德.賓

235
00:19:24,09 --> 00:19:26,18
Oh,no,I don't.
不,我不愛

236
00:19:26,36 --> 00:19:31,35
Why do we keep ending up together? New Year's,who invited who?
那麼就捫心自問,我們為何總是會復合? 新年是誰邀誰?

237
00:19:31,57 --> 00:19:35,59
-Valentine's,who asked who into bed? -I did,but
-情人節是誰邀誰上床? -是我,可是…

238
00:19:35,77 --> 00:19:37,40
You seek me out!
我是你尋找的對象

239
00:19:37,54 --> 00:19:42,57
Something deep in your soul calls out to me like a foghorn!
你的內心深處不斷呼喊著我

240
00:19:42,78 --> 00:19:46,58
Janice! Janice!
珍妮絲…珍妮絲…

241
00:19:46,85 --> 00:19:50,91
You push me away, you pull me back!
你推開我,你拉回我!

242
00:19:51,32 --> 00:19:53,88
You want me. You need me.
你要我,你需要我

243
00:19:54,09 --> 00:19:58,99
You can't live without me. And you know it.
你不能沒有我.你知道

244
00:19:59,39 --> 00:20:04,83
You just don't know you know it.
你只是不知道你知道罷了

245
00:20:07,83 --> 00:20:10,03
See?
明白嗎?

246
00:20:15,74 --> 00:20:18,40
Call me!
打電話給我

247
00:20:25,59 --> 00:20:29,61
It's not true. I never called your mother a wolverine.
這不是真的.我沒說你媽是狼人

248
00:20:29,86 --> 00:20:33,16
You did so,I swear to
你有,我發誓

249
00:20:36,23 --> 00:20:39,36
How long has she been in the bathroom?
她上洗手間多久了?

250
00:20:39,57 --> 00:20:42,80
She isn't in the bathroom. Her coat's gone.
我想她不是去上洗手間,她的外套不見了

251
00:20:42,97 --> 00:20:46,63
Well,maybe it's cold in there.
或許是太冷吧

252
00:20:47,47 --> 00:20:50,67
I screwed up my first date in nine years.
或許我搞砸了九年來的第一次約會

253
00:20:50,91 --> 00:20:54,54
-That could be it. -Oh,God.
-有可能 -天哪

254
00:20:54,68 --> 00:20:58,62
You know,this is still pretty hot.
知道嗎,這裡還是很熱

255
00:21:01,79 --> 00:21:04,09
Mushroom.
磨菇

256
00:21:04,39 --> 00:21:06,45
Smile.
微笑

257
00:21:06,66 --> 00:21:11,19
They won't all be like this. Some might stay through dinner.
不會每次都這樣的 還是有些女人會把晚餐吃完的

258
00:21:11,40 --> 00:21:14,60
-I'm sorry. That's not funny. -It's just....
-抱歉,不好笑 -只是

259
00:21:14,80 --> 00:21:18,36
You know the whole "get on with your life" thing?
人們老說要繼續你的人生

260
00:21:18,57 --> 00:21:20,87
Well,do I have to?
我必須嗎?

261
00:21:21,07 --> 00:21:25,91
I'm sitting here with this cute woman...
我和這位美女坐在這兒

262
00:21:26,15 --> 00:21:29,24
...and she's perfectly nice,but that...
她是那麼好

263
00:21:31,62 --> 00:21:33,59
...that's it.
但就這麼吹了

264
00:21:33,79 --> 00:21:38,72
Then I'm here talking to you, and it's easy and it's fun.
我現在又和你聊天,輕鬆又自在

265
00:21:38,99 --> 00:21:41,43
And I don't have to....
我何必…

266
00:21:41,83 --> 00:21:44,32
-I know. -You know?
-我懂 -你懂?

267
00:21:47,53 --> 00:21:50,66
Here's a wacky thought.
我有個瘋狂的念頭

268
00:21:50,87 --> 00:21:54,57
Let's say you and I give it another shot.
我們再試一次好嗎?

269
00:21:54,74 --> 00:21:58,27
I know what you're gonna say. You're a lesbian.
我知道你要說你是個女同志

270
00:21:59,35 --> 00:22:04,25
But what do you say we just put that aside for now.
但何不暫時將它擺在一旁

271
00:22:04,45 --> 00:22:07,11
Let's just stick a pin in it.
完全不去想它

272
00:22:07,32 --> 00:22:13,23
Because we're great together. You can't deny it.
因為我們在一起很開心 這不容你否認

273
00:22:13,59 --> 00:22:17,53
I've got a ring at home that fits you.
我有一個適合你的戒指

274
00:22:17,73 --> 00:22:22,57
I've got lots of pictures with both of us in them.
我有無數我倆一起的照片

275
00:22:22,77 --> 00:22:26,97
And best of all, you're carrying my baby.
最美妙的地方是,你懷著我的孩子

276
00:22:27,17 --> 00:22:29,87
-I mean,how perfect is that? -Ross
-這樣不是很完美嗎? -羅斯

277
00:22:30,04 --> 00:22:35,71
You keep saying that,but there's something right here. I love you.
雖然你一直回絕, 但我仍然想對你說,我愛你

278
00:22:42,52 --> 00:22:45,46
I love you too.
我也愛你

279
00:22:45,93 --> 00:22:48,33
-But -No "but."
-但是 -不要但是

280
00:22:49,56 --> 00:22:54,59
You know that thing we put over here with the pin in it?
你要知道,暫時攔置一旁的事

281
00:22:55,74 --> 00:23:00,07
It's time to take the pin out.
遲早會浮現的

282
00:23:04,85 --> 00:23:08,75
You'll find someone. The right woman is waiting for you.
你會找到對象的,合適的女人正在等著你

283
00:23:09,02 --> 00:23:13,48
It's easy for you to say. You found one already.
你說得倒是輕鬆,你已找到合適的女人

284
00:23:14,35 --> 00:23:18,45
All you need is a woman who likes men, and you'll be set.
你只需找到愛男人的女人即可

285
00:23:21,46 --> 00:23:24,40
Not her.
不是她

286
00:23:35,34 --> 00:23:39,44
So,you guys really slide down a pole?
你們真的從一個柱子上滑下去?

287
00:23:41,92 --> 00:23:45,94
-Absolutely. -That's so cool.
-絕對的 -太酷了

288
00:23:46,62 --> 00:23:49,15
How do you get back up?
那你們怎麼回上面的呢?

289
00:23:51,06 --> 00:23:55,69
Well,we rarely have to return from a fire as quickly.
我們很少需要像著火一樣急的往上去

290
00:23:58,73 --> 00:24:01,36
So,would you guys....
你們這些小伙…

291
00:24:01,57 --> 00:24:06,44
Would you like to,sometime,maybe....
你們願意,有時,可能…

292
00:24:06,64 --> 00:24:08,61
Go for a drink sometime?
有時一起出去喝一杯

293
00:24:08,81 --> 00:24:10,17
Sure,sounds good.
當然,聽起來不錯

294
00:24:10,38 --> 00:24:13,71
We get off at midnight. We'll pick you up then.
我們午夜下班之後,來找你們可以嗎?

295
00:24:13,91 --> 00:24:15,58
Okay. Great!
好啊,太好了

296
00:24:16,55 --> 00:24:20,28
So will you bring the truck?
你們會開消防車過來嗎?

297
00:24:21,62 --> 00:24:24,22
I'll even let you ring the bell.
還會讓你們拉警鈴

298
00:24:24,42 --> 00:24:28,22
-We'll see you later. -Bye! See you later!
再見了…晚安,再見…

299
00:24:29,43 --> 00:24:30,73
Oh,my God!
天啊

300
00:24:31,87 --> 00:24:34,63
See? There you go. The cleansing worked.
看到沒有?清理儀式奏效了

301
00:24:34,84 --> 00:24:37,90
You're right. They're nice guys!
沒錯,他們是好男人

302
00:24:38,07 --> 00:24:41,94
They're firemen guys!
他們是消防隊員

303
00:24:42,11 --> 00:24:46,48
-Tell them you're married? -No. My girlfriend doesn't even know.
-你們有告訴她們你們已婚嗎? -當然沒有,連我女友都不知道

304
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


305
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


